Package: taxiintegration
Title: API <-> UI Integration Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Checks that the three descriptions of the system agree with each
    other: the two OpenAPI contracts, the routes the API actually registers and
    the paths the two clients (app/ and share/) actually call. Contract drift
    is cheap to catch here and expensive to discover in production.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    yaml
Config/testthat/edition: 3
